Notebook[{
Cell["Graphical calculus, Chapter 4: non-degenerate, pre-fusion and fusion categories", "Title"],
Cell["Turaev & Virelizier, Monoidal Categories and Topological Field Theory, \:00a74.3.2 and \:00a74.5.2\:20134.7, pp. 70\:201387 \:00b7 sections 70\:201379 \:00b7 Lemmas 4.2, 4.6\:20134.10", "Subtitle"],
Cell["By Dara O Shayda and Noor Hoshino (\:661f\:91ce\:30cc\:30fc\:30eb)", "Text"],
Cell["69. Setup", "Section"],
Cell["The first cell loads the engine from this folder (Desktop/Research/Monoidal Graphical Calculus). The code of this notebook is also saved as fusion-4.wl. The editor's symbolic rules for Chapter 4 are in fusion-4-rules.wl, which the GraphicalCalculusKernel loads; this notebook checks the statements, and the proof steps, in a matrix model.", "Text"],
Cell["ClearAll[\"Global`*\"];\n(* the engine (sections 0\:201319 give LD, B and rows), all in this folder *)\ndir = FileNameJoin[{$HomeDirectory, \"Desktop\", \"Research\", \"Monoidal Graphical Calculus\"}];\nWith[{cells = Cases[Get[FileNameJoin[{dir, \"graphical-calculus-2.1-simplify.nb\"}]], Cell[c_, \"Input\" | \"Code\", ___] :> c, Infinity]},\n Scan[Quiet@Check[TimeConstrained[ToExpression[#, StandardForm]; Null, 120], Null] &, cells];\n Print[\"Loaded \", Length[cells], \" code cells from graphical-calculus-2.1-simplify.nb\"]];\ndir = FileNameJoin[{$HomeDirectory, \"Desktop\", \"Research\", \"Monoidal Graphical Calculus\"}];", "Input"],
Cell["70. The model: graded vector spaces with a pivotal structure", "Section"],
Cell["Objects are graded vector spaces: a colour is a list of grades, one per basis vector. The simple objects are the\n   one-dimensional spaces k_g, so I = the grading group. A character w gives the pivotal structure: ev and coev are the\n   plain pairings, \:1ebdv_X and c\:0303oev_X carry w(g) and 1/w(g) on a basis vector of grade g, so dim_l(k_g) = 1/w(g) and\n   dim_r(k_g) = w(g). With w(g) = 2^g the category is pivotal and not spherical, so every dimension factor in \:00a74.7 is\n   really tested. The braiding is \:03c4(e_a \:2297 e_b) = q^(g_a g_b) e_b \:2297 e_a. The editor identifies X** with X, so a starred\n   colour gets the swapped structure: ev_X* = \:1ebdv_X, \:1ebdv_X* = ev_X, coev_X* = c\:0303oev_X, c\:0303oev_X* = coev_X.", "Text"],
Cell["fMod = 0;  fw = 2;  fq = 3;                          (* the group Z (fMod = 0) or Z/n (fMod = n); weight base; braiding base *)\nfGr = <|\"X\" -> {0, 1, 1, 2}, \"Y\" -> {1, -1, 0}, \"W\" -> {2, 2, 0, 1}, \"i\" -> {1}, \"j\" -> {2}, \"k\" -> {-1}, \"n\" -> {1}|>;\nfI = Range[-4, 6];                                   (* the simple objects k_g that sums over I run through *)\nfUnit = \"\\[DoubleStruckOne]\";\ngnorm[g_] := If[fMod == 0, g, Mod[g, fMod]];\nfStarQ[c_String] := StringEndsQ[c, \"*\"];\nfStar[c_String] := If[fStarQ[c], StringDrop[c, -1], c <> \"*\"];\nfBase[c_String] := StringReplace[c, \"*\" -> \"\"];\nfParity[c_String] := Mod[StringCount[c, \"*\"], 2];\nfGrades[c_String] := If[fParity[c] == 1, gnorm /@ (-fGr[fBase[c]]), gnorm /@ fGr[fBase[c]]];\nfDim[c_String] := Length[fGrades[c]];\nfDims[cs_List] := Times @@ (fDim /@ cs);\nfWt[g_] := fw^g;\nfBasis[cs_List] := Tuples[Range /@ (fDim /@ cs)];      (* basis of a tensor product, first colour most significant *)\nfGradeOf[cs_List, idx_List] := gnorm[Total[MapThread[fGrades[#1][[#2]] &, {cs, idx}]]];\nfSimpleGrade[c_String] := If[c === fUnit, 0, First[fGrades[c]]];\n\n(* the four caps and cups *)\nfEv[x_] := With[{g = fGrades[x], n = fDim[x]}, {Flatten[Table[If[a == b, If[fParity[x] == 0, 1, fWt[-g[[a]]]], 0], {a, n}, {b, n}]]}];   (* x* \:2297 x \:2192 \|01d7d9 *)\nfEvt[x_] := With[{g = fGrades[x], n = fDim[x]}, {Flatten[Table[If[a == b, If[fParity[x] == 0, fWt[g[[a]]], 1], 0], {a, n}, {b, n}]]}];   (* x \:2297 x* \:2192 \|01d7d9 *)\nfCoev[x_] := With[{g = fGrades[x], n = fDim[x]}, Transpose[{Flatten[Table[If[a == b, If[fParity[x] == 0, 1, fWt[g[[a]]]], 0], {a, n}, {b, n}]]}]];   (* \|01d7d9 \:2192 x \:2297 x* *)\nfCoevt[x_] := With[{g = fGrades[x], n = fDim[x]}, Transpose[{Flatten[Table[If[a == b, If[fParity[x] == 0, fWt[-g[[a]]], 1], 0], {a, n}, {b, n}]]}]];   (* \|01d7d9 \:2192 x* \:2297 x *)\nfFlip[x_, y_, s_] := With[{gx = fGrades[x], gy = fGrades[y], nx = fDim[x], ny = fDim[y]},\n   Normal[SparseArray[Flatten[Table[{(b - 1) nx + a, (a - 1) ny + b} -> fq^(s gx[[a]] gy[[b]]), {a, nx}, {b, ny}]], {nx ny, nx ny}]]];\n\n(* random morphisms that respect the grading *)\nfRandom[dom_List, cod_List] := Table[If[fGradeOf[cod, o] == fGradeOf[dom, i], RandomInteger[{-3, 3}], 0], {o, fBasis[cod]}, {i, fBasis[dom]}];", "Input"],
Cell["71. Partition pairs (\:00a74.4.1, \:00a74.6.1) and the evaluation of a quasi-diagram", "Section"],
Cell["A pair is declared as tag -> {W, i}: an i-partition of W = X1 \:2297 ... \:2297 Xn (i simple, or fUnit for a 1-partition).\n   Its boxes are B[Subscript[\"p\", tag], W, {i}] (the semi-disk p_\:03b1 : W \:2192 i) and B[Subscript[\"q\", tag], {i}, W]\n   (the compressed rectangle q_\:03b1 : i \:2192 W); for i = \|01d7d9 the i-arc is erased. The pair stands for \:03a3_\:03b1 p_\:03b1 \:2297 q_\:03b1, so a\n   quasi-diagram is evaluated as the sum over the basis vectors \:03b1 of Hom(W, i) for every pair, as in (4.4)\:2013(4.6):\n   p_\:03b1 is the coordinate of the basis vector \:03b1 of grade g_i, q_\:03b1 its inclusion.", "Text"],
Cell["fPairs = <||>;\npB[t_] := With[{d = fPairs[t]}, B[Subscript[\"p\", t], d[[1]], If[d[[2]] === fUnit, {}, {d[[2]]}]]];\nqB[t_] := With[{d = fPairs[t]}, B[Subscript[\"q\", t], If[d[[2]] === fUnit, {}, {d[[2]]}], d[[1]]]];\nfAlphas[t_] := With[{d = fPairs[t]}, Select[fBasis[d[[1]]], fGradeOf[d[[1]], #] == fSimpleGrade[d[[2]]] &]];\nfN[i_String, ws_List] := Count[fBasis[ws], v_ /; fGradeOf[ws, v] == fSimpleGrade[i]];   (* the multiplicity index N^i_W *)\nfMats = <||>;\n\nfBoxMat[b_B, env_] := With[{s = b[[1]], in = b[[2]], out = b[[3]]},\n   Which[\n    MatchQ[s, Subscript[\"ev\", _]], fEv[s[[2]]],\n    MatchQ[s, Subscript[OverTilde[\"ev\"], _]], fEvt[s[[2]]],\n    MatchQ[s, Subscript[\"coev\", _]], fCoev[s[[2]]],\n    MatchQ[s, Subscript[OverTilde[\"coev\"], _]], fCoevt[s[[2]]],\n    MatchQ[s, Subscript[\"\\[Tau]\", _]] && Length[in] == 2, fFlip[in[[1]], in[[2]], 1],\n    MatchQ[s, Subscript[Superscript[\"\\[Tau]\", \"-1\"], _]] && Length[in] == 2, fFlip[in[[1]], in[[2]], -1],\n    MatchQ[s, Subscript[\"p\", _]], With[{al = env[s[[2]]], bs = fBasis[in]}, {Boole[# === al] & /@ bs}],\n    MatchQ[s, Subscript[\"q\", _]], With[{al = env[s[[2]]], bs = fBasis[out]}, Transpose[{Boole[# === al] & /@ bs}]],\n    s === \"id\", IdentityMatrix[fDims[in]],\n    KeyExistsQ[fMats, s], fMats[s],\n    True, (fMats[s] = fRandom[in, out])]];\nfEvalEnv[ld_LD, env_] := Module[{rs = rows[ld], m},\n   m = IdentityMatrix[fDims[First[rs]]];\n   Do[With[{a = ld[[2, k, 1]], b = ld[[2, k, 2]], row = rs[[k]]},\n     m = KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[fDims[Take[row, a]]], fBoxMat[b, env], IdentityMatrix[fDims[Drop[row, a + Length[b[[2]]]]]]] . m], {k, Length[ld[[2]]]}];\n   m];\nfTags[ld_LD] := DeleteDuplicates[Cases[ld[[2]], B[Subscript[\"p\" | \"q\", t_], __] :> t, Infinity]];\nfEval[ld_LD] := With[{ts = fTags[ld]},\n   If[ts === {}, fEvalEnv[ld, <||>],\n    Total[fEvalEnv[ld, AssociationThread[ts, #]] & /@ Tuples[fAlphas /@ ts]] /. 0 -> 0]];\nfEval0[ld_LD] := With[{m = fEval[ld]}, If[m === 0, ConstantArray[0, {fDims[Last[rows[ld]]], fDims[First[rows[ld]]]}], m]];\n\n(* terms of the enriched calculus: {coefficient, {summation variables}, LD}. Scalars: dl[c], dr[c], NN[i, W], del[i, j], a[i] *)\nfScalar[e_] := e /. {dl[c_String] :> Total[fWt[-#] & /@ fGrades[c]], dr[c_String] :> Total[fWt /@ fGrades[c]],\n     NN[i_String, ws_List] :> fN[i, ws], del[i_String, j_String] :> Boole[fSimpleGrade[i] == fSimpleGrade[j]],\n     delo[i_String, j_String] :> Boole[gnorm[-fSimpleGrade[i]] == fSimpleGrade[j]], a[c_String] :> fA[fSimpleGrade[c]]};\nfA[g_] := fA[g] = RandomInteger[{1, 9}];\nfTerm[{c_, {}, ld_LD}] := fScalar[c] fEval0[ld];\nfTerm[{c_, {v_, rest___}, ld_LD}] := Total[Table[Block[{fGr = Append[fGr, v -> {g}], fPairs = fPairs},\n     fTerm[{c, {rest}, ld}]], {g, fI}]];\nfSum[terms_List] := Total[fTerm /@ terms];\nfEqual[l_List, r_List] := (Expand[fSum[l] - fSum[r]] // Flatten // Union) === {0};\nfEqualAll[sides_List] := And @@ (fEqual[First[sides], #] & /@ Rest[sides]);", "Input"],
Cell["72. Building diagrams: composition (bottom first) and tensor products of boxes", "Section"],
Cell["ev[x_] := B[Subscript[\"ev\", x], {fStar[x], x}, {}];  evt[x_] := B[Subscript[OverTilde[\"ev\"], x], {x, fStar[x]}, {}];\ncoev[x_] := B[Subscript[\"coev\", x], {}, {x, fStar[x]}];  coevt[x_] := B[Subscript[OverTilde[\"coev\"], x], {}, {fStar[x], x}];\ntauF[x_, y_] := B[Subscript[\"\\[Tau]\", x <> \",\" <> y], {x, y}, {y, x}];\nbox[f_, d_List, c_List] := B[f, d, c];\nidc[cs___String] := {\"id\", {cs}};\n(* an expression: a box B[...], {\"id\", colours}, tens[e1, e2, ...] or comp[e1, e2, ...] with e1 applied first *)\nfDom[b_B] := b[[2]];  fCod[b_B] := b[[3]];  fDom[{\"id\", cs_}] := cs;  fCod[{\"id\", cs_}] := cs;\nfDom[tens[es__]] := Join @@ (fDom /@ {es});  fCod[tens[es__]] := Join @@ (fCod /@ {es});\nfDom[comp[es__]] := fDom[First[{es}]];  fCod[comp[es__]] := fCod[Last[{es}]];\nfLayers[b_B] := {{0, b}};  fLayers[{\"id\", _}] := {};\nfLayers[comp[es__]] := Join @@ (fLayers /@ {es});\nfLayers[tens[es__]] := Module[{off = 0, out = {}, es2 = {es}},\n   Do[out = Join[out, {#[[1]] + off, #[[2]]} & /@ fLayers[es2[[k]]]]; off += Length[fCod[es2[[k]]]], {k, Length[es2]}];\n   out];\ntoLD4[e_] := LD[fDom[e], fLayers[e]];\nT[c_, e_] := {c, {}, toLD4[e]};  TS[c_, vs_List, e_] := {c, vs, toLD4[e]};", "Input"],
Cell["73. \:00a74.3.2 and Lemma 4.2", "Section"],
Cell["\:03c9_S(\:03b1 \:2297 \:03b2) = ev_S(\:03b1 \:2297 \:03b2) is unchanged when the closed diagram is turned through 180\:00b0: \:03c9_((X,\:2212),(Y,+))(\:03b1 \:2297 \:03b2) = \:03c9_((Y,\:2212),(X,+))(\:03b2 \:2297 \:03b1)", "Text"],
Cell["alB = box[\"\\[Alpha]\", {}, {\"Y*\", \"X\"}];  beB = box[\"\\[Beta]\", {}, {\"X*\", \"Y\"}];\nomega432 = {T[1, comp[tens[alB, beB], tens[idc[\"Y*\"], evt[\"X\"], idc[\"Y\"]], ev[\"Y\"]]], T[1, comp[tens[beB, alB], tens[idc[\"X*\"], evt[\"Y\"], idc[\"X\"]], ev[\"X\"]]]};\nhB = box[\"h\", {\"i\"}, {\"i\"}];\ntrLc[c_, f_] := comp[coevt[c], tens[idc[fStar[c]], f], ev[c]];  trRc[c_, f_] := comp[coev[c], tens[f, idc[fStar[c]]], evt[c]];\nlemma42 = <|\n   \"(a) \\[Omega]_S(coev_i \\[CircleTimes] coev_i) = dim_r(i)\" -> {T[1, comp[tens[coev[\"i\"], coev[\"i\"]], tens[idc[\"i\"], ev[\"i\"], idc[\"i*\"]], evt[\"i\"]]], T[1, trRc[\"i\", idc[\"i\"]]], T[dr[\"i\"], idc[]]},\n   \"(a) with S = ((i,\\[Minus]),(i,+)): dim_l(i)\" -> {T[1, comp[tens[coevt[\"i\"], coevt[\"i\"]], tens[idc[\"i*\"], evt[\"i\"], idc[\"i\"]], ev[\"i\"]]], T[dl[\"i\"], idc[]]},\n   \"(b) f = dim_l(i)\\:207b\\:00b9 tr_l(f) id_i\" -> {T[1, hB], T[dl[\"i\"]^-1, tens[idc[\"i\"], trLc[\"i\", hB]]]},\n   \"(b) f = dim_r(i)\\:207b\\:00b9 tr_r(f) id_i\" -> {T[1, hB], T[dr[\"i\"]^-1, tens[idc[\"i\"], trRc[\"i\", hB]]]},\n   \"(4.2) dim_l(i) tr_r(f) = dim_r(i) tr_l(f)\" -> {T[dl[\"i\"], trRc[\"i\", hB]], T[dr[\"i\"], trLc[\"i\", hB]]}|>;", "Input"],
Cell["74. \:00a74.6.3: (4.7)\:2013(4.10)", "Section"],
Cell["fPairs = <|\"a\" -> {{\"X\"}, \"i\"}, \"u\" -> {{\"X\"}, fUnit}|>;\nfB = box[\"f\", {}, {\"X\"}];  gB = box[\"g\", {\"X\"}, {}];\nprops463 = <|\n   \"(4.7) p q = N^i_X id_i\" -> {T[1, comp[qB[\"a\"], pB[\"a\"]]], T[NN[\"i\", {\"X\"}], idc[\"i\"]]},\n   \"(4.8) \\[Sum]_i q p = id_X\" -> {TS[1, {\"i\"}, comp[pB[\"a\"], qB[\"a\"]]], T[1, idc[\"X\"]]},\n   \"(4.9) q p f = f\" -> {T[1, comp[fB, pB[\"u\"], qB[\"u\"]]], T[1, fB]},\n   \"(4.9) g q p = g\" -> {T[1, comp[pB[\"u\"], qB[\"u\"], gB]], T[1, gB]},\n   \"(4.10) dim_l(X) = \\[Sum]_i dim_l(i) N^i_X\" -> {T[1, comp[coevt[\"X\"], ev[\"X\"]]], TS[1, {\"i\"}, trLc[\"X\", comp[pB[\"a\"], qB[\"a\"]]]],\n      TS[1, {\"i\"}, trLc[\"i\", comp[qB[\"a\"], pB[\"a\"]]]], TS[NN[\"i\", {\"X\"}], {\"i\"}, trLc[\"i\", idc[\"i\"]]], TS[dl[\"i\"] NN[\"i\", {\"X\"}], {\"i\"}, idc[]]},\n   \"(4.10) dim_r(X) = \\[Sum]_i dim_r(i) N^i_X\" -> {T[1, comp[coev[\"X\"], evt[\"X\"]]], TS[1, {\"i\"}, trRc[\"X\", comp[pB[\"a\"], qB[\"a\"]]]],\n      TS[1, {\"i\"}, trRc[\"i\", comp[qB[\"a\"], pB[\"a\"]]]], TS[dr[\"i\"] NN[\"i\", {\"X\"}], {\"i\"}, idc[]]}|>;", "Input"],
Cell["75. Lemma 4.8: the contraction vector of \:03c9_S", "Section"],
Cell["lemma48pairs = <|\"u\" -> {{\"X\"}, fUnit}, \"v\" -> {{\"X\", \"Y*\"}, fUnit}|>;\nlemma48 = Block[{fPairs = lemma48pairs},\n   With[{f1 = box[\"f1\", {}, {\"X\"}], g1 = box[\"g1\", {}, {\"X*\"}], f2 = box[\"f2\", {}, {\"X\", \"Y*\"}], g2 = box[\"g2\", {}, {\"Y\", \"X*\"}],\n     pbent1 = comp[coevt[\"X\"], tens[idc[\"X*\"], pB[\"u\"]]],\n     pbent2 = comp[coev[\"Y\"], tens[idc[\"Y\"], coevt[\"X\"], idc[\"Y*\"]], tens[idc[\"Y\", \"X*\"], pB[\"v\"]]],\n     evS2 = comp[tens[idc[\"Y\"], ev[\"X\"], idc[\"Y*\"]], evt[\"Y\"]]},\n    <|\"S = (X,+): (id \\[CircleTimes] \\[Omega]_S)(\\[Star]_S \\[CircleTimes] f) = f\" -> {T[1, tens[qB[\"u\"], comp[tens[pbent1, f1], ev[\"X\"]]]], T[1, comp[f1, pB[\"u\"], qB[\"u\"]]], T[1, f1]},\n     \"S = (X,+): (\\[Omega]_S \\[CircleTimes] id)(g \\[CircleTimes] \\[Star]_S) = g\" -> {T[1, tens[comp[tens[g1, qB[\"u\"]], ev[\"X\"]], pbent1]], T[1, g1]},\n     \"S = ((X,+),(Y,\\[Minus])): (id \\[CircleTimes] \\[Omega]_S)(\\[Star]_S \\[CircleTimes] f) = f\" -> {T[1, tens[qB[\"v\"], comp[tens[pbent2, f2], evS2]]], T[1, comp[f2, pB[\"v\"], qB[\"v\"]]], T[1, f2]},\n     \"S = ((X,+),(Y,\\[Minus])): (\\[Omega]_S \\[CircleTimes] id)(g \\[CircleTimes] \\[Star]_S) = g\" -> {T[1, tens[comp[tens[g2, qB[\"v\"]], evS2], pbent2]], T[1, g2]}|>]];", "Input"],
Cell["76. Lemma 4.9", "Section"],
Cell["lemma49pairs = <|\"b\" -> {{\"i\"}, \"j\"}, \"b2\" -> {{\"i\"}, \"n\"}, \"c\" -> {{\"i*\"}, \"k\"}, \"c2\" -> {{\"i*\"}, \"j\"},\n   \"d\" -> {{\"i*\", \"j\"}, fUnit}, \"d2\" -> {{\"i*\", \"n\"}, fUnit}, \"e\" -> {{\"i\", \"j*\"}, fUnit}, \"e2\" -> {{\"i\", \"n*\"}, fUnit},\n   \"a2\" -> {{\"X\"}, \"i\"}, \"o\" -> {{\"i*\", \"X\"}, fUnit}, \"o2\" -> {{\"X\", \"i*\"}, fUnit},\n   \"ei\" -> {{\"k*\", \"j\", \"W*\"}, \"i\"}, \"ej\" -> {{\"k\", \"i\", \"W\"}, \"j\"}, \"fi\" -> {{\"W*\", \"j\", \"k*\"}, \"i\"}, \"fj\" -> {{\"W\", \"i\", \"k\"}, \"j\"},\n   \"gA\" -> {{\"X\"}, \"j\"}, \"gB\" -> {{\"j\", \"Y\"}, \"i\"}, \"gC\" -> {{\"X\", \"Y\"}, \"i\"}, \"gA2\" -> {{\"Y\"}, \"j\"}, \"gB2\" -> {{\"X\", \"j\"}, \"i\"}|>;\nfMats[\"\\[Phi]\"] = {{5}};  fMats[\"\\[Phi]\\:207b\\:00b9\"] = {{1/5}};\nlemma49 = Block[{fPairs = lemma49pairs},\n   <|\"(a) i \\[NotEqual] j\" -> {T[1, tens[pB[\"b\"], qB[\"b\"]]], T[del[\"i\", \"j\"], idc[\"i\", \"i\"]]},\n     \"(a) i = j\" -> {T[1, tens[pB[\"b2\"], qB[\"b2\"]]], T[del[\"i\", \"n\"], idc[\"i\", \"i\"]]},\n     \"(a) i* \\[TildeEqual] j\" -> {T[1, tens[pB[\"c\"], qB[\"c\"]]], T[delo[\"i\", \"k\"], tens[box[\"\\[Phi]\", {\"i*\"}, {\"k\"}], box[\"\\[Phi]\\:207b\\:00b9\", {\"k\"}, {\"i*\"}]]]},\n     \"(a) i* \\[NotTilde] j\" -> {T[1, tens[pB[\"c2\"], qB[\"c2\"]]], T[delo[\"i\", \"j\"], tens[box[\"\\[Phi]\", {\"i*\"}, {\"j\"}], box[\"\\[Phi]\\:207b\\:00b9\", {\"j\"}, {\"i*\"}]]]},\n     \"(b) i \\[NotEqual] j\" -> {T[1, tens[pB[\"d\"], qB[\"d\"]]], T[del[\"i\", \"j\"] dl[\"i\"]^-1, tens[ev[\"i\"], coevt[\"i\"]]]},\n     \"(b) i = j\" -> {T[1, tens[pB[\"d2\"], qB[\"d2\"]]], T[del[\"i\", \"n\"] dl[\"i\"]^-1, tens[ev[\"i\"], coevt[\"i\"]]]},\n     \"(c) i \\[NotEqual] j\" -> {T[1, tens[pB[\"e\"], qB[\"e\"]]], T[del[\"i\", \"j\"] dr[\"i\"]^-1, tens[evt[\"i\"], coev[\"i\"]]]},\n     \"(c) i = j\" -> {T[1, tens[pB[\"e2\"], qB[\"e2\"]]], T[del[\"i\", \"n\"] dr[\"i\"]^-1, tens[evt[\"i\"], coev[\"i\"]]]},\n     \"(d)\" -> {T[1, tens[pB[\"a2\"], qB[\"a2\"]]],\n        T[dl[\"i\"], tens[comp[tens[coev[\"i\"], idc[\"X\"]], tens[idc[\"i\"], pB[\"o\"]]], comp[tens[idc[\"i\"], qB[\"o\"]], tens[evt[\"i\"], idc[\"X\"]]]]],\n        T[dr[\"i\"], tens[comp[tens[idc[\"X\"], coevt[\"i\"]], tens[pB[\"o2\"], idc[\"i\"]]], comp[tens[qB[\"o2\"], idc[\"i\"]], tens[idc[\"X\"], ev[\"i\"]]]]]},\n     \"(e)\" -> {T[1, tens[comp[tens[idc[\"k\"], qB[\"ei\"], idc[\"W\"]], tens[evt[\"k\"], idc[\"j\"], ev[\"W\"]]], comp[tens[coev[\"k\"], idc[\"j\"], coevt[\"W\"]], tens[idc[\"k\"], pB[\"ei\"], idc[\"W\"]]]]],\n        T[dr[\"i\"] dr[\"k\"]/(dr[\"j\"] dl[\"k\"]), tens[pB[\"ej\"], qB[\"ej\"]]]},\n     \"(f)\" -> {T[1, tens[comp[tens[idc[\"W\"], qB[\"fi\"], idc[\"k\"]], tens[evt[\"W\"], idc[\"j\"], ev[\"k\"]]], comp[tens[coev[\"W\"], idc[\"j\"], coevt[\"k\"]], tens[idc[\"W\"], pB[\"fi\"], idc[\"k\"]]]]],\n        T[dl[\"i\"] dl[\"k\"]/(dl[\"j\"] dr[\"k\"]), tens[pB[\"fj\"], qB[\"fj\"]]]},\n     \"(g)\" -> {TS[1, {\"j\"}, tens[comp[tens[pB[\"gA\"], idc[\"Y\"]], pB[\"gB\"]], comp[qB[\"gB\"], tens[qB[\"gA\"], idc[\"Y\"]]]]],\n        T[1, tens[pB[\"gC\"], qB[\"gC\"]]],\n        TS[1, {\"j\"}, tens[comp[tens[idc[\"X\"], pB[\"gA2\"]], pB[\"gB2\"]], comp[qB[\"gB2\"], tens[idc[\"X\"], qB[\"gA2\"]]]]]}|>];", "Input"],
Cell["77. Lemma 4.10", "Section"],
Cell["f_j,k = a_k c\:0303oev_k ev_j and g_j,k = \:03a3_i a_i (q* \:2297 p)(id_j* \:2297 c\:0303oev_i \:2297 id_j), (p, q) a k-partition of i \:2297 j", "Text"],
Cell["qStar[t_, x_, y_, z_] := comp[tens[idc[fStar[y], fStar[x]], coev[z]], tens[idc[fStar[y], fStar[x]], qB[t], idc[fStar[z]]],\n   tens[idc[fStar[y]], ev[x], idc[y], idc[fStar[z]]], tens[ev[y], idc[fStar[z]]]];     (* q : z \:2192 x \:2297 y, q* : y* \:2297 x* \:2192 z* *)\nf410[j_, k_] := T[a[k], comp[ev[j], coevt[k]]];\ng410[j_, k_] := TS[a[\"i\"], {\"i\"}, comp[tens[idc[fStar[j]], coevt[\"i\"], idc[j]], tens[qStar[\"h\", \"i\", j, k], pB[\"h\"]]]];\ndualize410[{c_, vs_, ld_LD}, j_, k_] := {c, vs, toLD4[comp[tens[idc[k, fStar[j]], coev[j]], tens[idc[k], {\"ld\", ld}, idc[fStar[j]]], tens[evt[k], idc[k, fStar[j]]]]]};\nfLayers[{\"ld\", l_LD}] := l[[2]];  fDom[{\"ld\", l_LD}] := l[[1]];  fCod[{\"ld\", l_LD}] := Last[rows[l]];\npairs410[j_, k_] := <|\"h\" -> {{\"i\", j}, k}, \"r\" -> {{k, fStar[j]}, \"i\"}|>;\nlemma410[j_, k_] := Block[{fPairs = Join[fPairs, pairs410[j, k]]},\n   <|\"f = g\" -> {{f410[j, k]}, {g410[j, k]}},\n     \"by duality: f \\[LongLeftRightArrow] a_k id\" -> {{dualize410[f410[j, k], j, k]}, {T[a[k], idc[k, fStar[j]]]}},\n     \"Lemma 4.9(e) step\" -> {{dualize410[g410[j, k], j, k]}, {TS[a[\"i\"] dr[k]/dr[\"i\"], {\"i\"}, comp[pB[\"r\"], qB[\"r\"]]]}}|>];", "Input"],
Cell["78. Lemma 4.6 (S-matrix) and Lemma 4.7 in Z/n-graded models", "Section"],
Cell["Lemma 4.7 in Z/3 with w(g) = \:03c9^g (pivotal fusion, not spherical): the proof as a chain of five equal numbers", "Text"],
Cell["lemma47[] := Block[{fMod = 3, fw = Exp[2 Pi I/3], fI = {0, 1, 2}, fGr = <|\"X\" -> {0, 1, 1, 2}, \"Y\" -> {1, 1, 0}, \"m\" -> {0}, \"nn\" -> {0}, \"kk\" -> {0}|>},\n   Module[{lhs, dimC, sumI},\n    sumI[v_, f_] := Total[Table[Block[{fGr = Append[fGr, v -> {g}]}, f[]], {g, fI}]];\n    dimC = sumI[\"m\", fScalar[dl[\"m\"] dr[\"m\"]] &];\n    lhs[l_] := sumI[\"m\", sumI[\"nn\", fScalar[l[\"m\"] l[\"nn\"]] fN[fUnit, {\"X\", \"m\", \"Y\", \"nn\"}] &] &];\n    <|\"steps\" -> FullSimplify /@ {lhs[dl],\n        sumI[\"m\", fScalar[dl[\"m\"]] sumI[\"nn\", fScalar[dr[\"nn*\"]] fN[\"nn*\", {\"X\", \"m\", \"Y\"}] &] &],\n        sumI[\"m\", fScalar[dl[\"m\"]] sumI[\"kk\", fScalar[dr[\"kk\"]] fN[\"kk\", {\"X\", \"m\", \"Y\"}] &] &],\n        sumI[\"m\", fScalar[dl[\"m\"]] Total[fWt /@ Flatten[Outer[gnorm[#1 + #2 + #3] &, fGrades[\"X\"], fGrades[\"m\"], fGrades[\"Y\"]]]] &],\n        fScalar[dr[\"X\"] dr[\"Y\"]] dimC},\n     \"exchanged\" -> FullSimplify /@ {lhs[dr], fScalar[dl[\"X\"] dl[\"Y\"]] dimC}|>]];\n(* Lemma 4.6 in the modular category of Z/n-graded vector spaces, n odd, braiding \:03b6^(gh) flip with \:03b6 = e^(2\:03c0i/n), spherical (w = 1) *)\ncurlS = toLD4[comp[tens[coevt[\"s\"], idc[\"s\"]], tens[idc[\"s*\"], tauF[\"s\", \"s\"]], tens[ev[\"s\"], idc[\"s\"]]]];\nlemma46[n_] := Block[{fMod = n, fw = 1, fq = Exp[2 Pi I/n], fI = Range[0, n - 1], fGr = <||>},\n   Module[{v, S, dim, dimC, dp, dm},\n    v = Table[Block[{fGr = <|\"s\" -> {g}|>}, fEval0[curlS][[1, 1]]], {g, fI}];                                 (* twist scalars v_i *)\n    S = Table[Block[{fGr = <|\"s\" -> {g}, \"t\" -> {h}|>}, Tr[fFlip[\"t\", \"s\", 1] . fFlip[\"s\", \"t\", 1]]], {g, fI}, {h, fI}];   (* S_i,j = tr(\:03c4_j,i \:03c4_i,j) *)\n    dim = ConstantArray[1, n]; dimC = Total[dim^2]; dp = Total[v dim^2]; dm = Total[dim^2/v];\n    <|\"S invertible (modular)\" -> (FullSimplify[Det[S]] =!= 0),\n      \"(a) \\[Sum]_j S_i,j S_j,r = dim(C) \\[Delta]_i\\[SmallCircle],r\" -> (Union[Flatten[Table[FullSimplify[Sum[S[[i, j]] S[[j, r]], {j, n}] - dimC Boole[Mod[i + r - 2, n] == 0]], {i, n}, {r, n}]]] === {0}),\n      \"\\[CapitalDelta]+ \\[CapitalDelta]- = dim(C)\" -> (FullSimplify[dp dm - dimC] == 0),\n      \"(b) as printed: \\[Sum]_j v_i v_j dim(j) S_i,j = dim(C) dim(i)\" -> (Union[Table[FullSimplify[Sum[v[[i]] v[[j]] dim[[j]] S[[i, j]], {j, n}] - dimC dim[[i]]], {i, n}]] === {0}),\n      \"(b) with \\[CapitalDelta]+: \\[Sum]_j v_i v_j dim(j) S_i,j = \\[CapitalDelta]+ dim(i)\" -> (Union[Table[FullSimplify[Sum[v[[i]] v[[j]] dim[[j]] S[[i, j]], {j, n}] - dp dim[[i]]], {i, n}]] === {0}),\n      \"\\[CapitalDelta]+\" -> FullSimplify[dp]|>]];", "Input"],
Cell["79. Checking", "Section"],
Cell["pairs463 = <|\"a\" -> {{\"X\"}, \"i\"}, \"u\" -> {{\"X\"}, fUnit}|>;\nwithPairs[ps_, expr_] := Block[{fPairs = ps}, expr];\nSetAttributes[withPairs, HoldRest];\nchkList[ps_, assoc_] := withPairs[ps, KeyValueMap[#1 -> fEqualAll[List /@ #2] &, assoc]];\nchk410[j_, k_] := Block[{fPairs = pairs410[j, k]}, KeyValueMap[#1 -> fEqual @@ #2 &, lemma410[j, k]]];", "Input"],
Cell["79a. Walkthrough", "Section"],
Cell["The model", "Subsection"],
Cell["Grades of X are {0, 1, 1, 2} and w(g) = 2^g. Then dim_l(X) = \:03a3 2^(\:2212g), dim_r(X) = \:03a3 2^g: the category is pivotal and not spherical. The multiplicity of the simple object k_1 in X is 2:", "Text"],
Cell["{fScalar[dl[\"X\"]], fScalar[dr[\"X\"]], fN[\"i\", {\"X\"}]}", "Input"],
Cell["A partition pair", "Subsection"],
Cell["The pair (p_\:03b1, q_\:03b1) of an i-partition of X stands for \:03a3_\:03b1 p_\:03b1 \:2297 q_\:03b1: here two basis vectors of grade 1. Stacked as q over p it is id_X restricted to the grade-1 part; summed over i \:2208 I it is id_X, which is (4.8):", "Text"],
Cell["withPairs[pairs463, {fTerm[T[1, comp[pB[\"a\"], qB[\"a\"]]]] // MatrixForm, fSum[{TS[1, {\"i\"}, comp[pB[\"a\"], qB[\"a\"]]]}] // MatrixForm}]", "Input"],
Cell["Lemma 4.9(e): the dimension factor", "Subsection"],
Cell["Both sides of Lemma 4.9(e) as matrices (k \:2297 i \:2297 W \:2297 j \:2192 j \:2297 k \:2297 i \:2297 W). With the book's factor dim_r(i) dim_r(k)/(dim_r(j) dim_l(k)) they agree; with the naive factor dim_l(i)/dim_l(j) they do not, because the category is not spherical:", "Text"],
Cell["withPairs[lemma49pairs, With[{l = fTerm[lemma49[\"(e)\"][[1]]], r = fTerm[lemma49[\"(e)\"][[2]]], f = fScalar[dr[\"i\"] dr[\"k\"]/(dr[\"j\"] dl[\"k\"])], g = fScalar[dl[\"i\"]/dl[\"j\"]]}, {l == r, l == g/f r, f, g}]]", "Input"],
Cell["Lemma 4.6: the S-matrix", "Subsection"],
Cell["Z/3 and Z/5 with the braiding \:03b6^(gh) \:00b7 flip are modular. Formula (a) holds; formula (b) as printed fails, and holds with \:0394+ in place of dim(C):", "Text"],
Cell["Dataset[<|\"Z/3\" -> lemma46[3], \"Z/5\" -> lemma46[5]|>]", "Input"],
Cell["79b. Tests", "Section"],
Cell["Every statement is checked in the model of section 70, with random graded boxes. Where a proof is a chain of equalities, every link is checked (the lists in sections 73\:201377 hold the chains).", "Text"],
Cell["SeedRandom[47];\n<|\n \"\:00a74.3.2: \\[Omega]_S(\\[Alpha] \\[CircleTimes] \\[Beta]) = \\[Omega]_S*(\\[Beta] \\[CircleTimes] \\[Alpha])\" -> fEqual[{omega432[[1]]}, {omega432[[2]]}],\n \"Lemma 4.2 (a), (b) and (4.2)\" -> (And @@ Values[chkList[<||>, lemma42]]),\n \"(4.7), (4.8), (4.9), (4.10), every step of (4.10)\" -> (And @@ Values[chkList[pairs463, props463]]),\n \"Lemma 4.7: the five numbers of the proof agree, also with l, r exchanged\" -> With[{r = lemma47[]}, Length[Union[r[\"steps\"]]] == 1 && SameQ @@ r[\"exchanged\"]],\n \"Lemma 4.8: \\[Star]_S is the contraction vector, S = (X,+) and S = ((X,+),(Y,\\[Minus]))\" -> (And @@ Values[chkList[lemma48pairs, lemma48]]),\n \"Lemma 4.9 (a)\\[Dash](g)\" -> (And @@ Values[chkList[lemma49pairs, lemma49]]),\n \"Lemma 4.10: with a_i = a_1 dim_r(i), f_j,k = g_j,k for all j, k\" -> Block[{fA}, fA[g_] := 7 fWt[g]; AllTrue[Flatten[Table[Values[chk410[j, k]], {j, {\"j\", \"k\", \"n\"}}, {k, {\"j\", \"k\", \"n\"}}]], TrueQ]],\n \"Lemma 4.10: with a_i = a_1 dim_l(i) or random a_i, f_j,k \\[NotEqual] g_j,k\" -> Block[{fA}, fA[g_] := 7 fWt[-g];\n     NoneTrue[Flatten[Table[chk410[j, k][[1, 2]], {j, {\"j\", \"k\", \"n\"}}, {k, {\"j\", \"k\", \"n\"}}]], TrueQ]],\n \"Lemma 4.10: the duality step and the Lemma 4.9(e) step hold for any a_i\" -> Block[{fA}, fA[g_] := fA[g] = RandomInteger[{1, 9}];\n     AllTrue[Flatten[Table[Rest[Values[chk410[j, k]]], {j, {\"j\", \"k\", \"n\"}}, {k, {\"j\", \"k\", \"n\"}}]], TrueQ]],\n \"Lemma 4.6 (a) and \\[CapitalDelta]+\\[CapitalDelta]- = dim(C) in Z/3 and Z/5\" -> AllTrue[{lemma46[3], lemma46[5]}, #[\"S invertible (modular)\"] && #[\"(a) \\[Sum]_j S_i,j S_j,r = dim(C) \\[Delta]_i\\[SmallCircle],r\"] && #[\"\\[CapitalDelta]+ \\[CapitalDelta]- = dim(C)\"] &],\n \"Lemma 4.6 (b): false as printed, true with \\[CapitalDelta]+ for dim(C)\" -> AllTrue[{lemma46[3], lemma46[5]}, ! #[\"(b) as printed: \\[Sum]_j v_i v_j dim(j) S_i,j = dim(C) dim(i)\"] && #[\"(b) with \\[CapitalDelta]+: \\[Sum]_j v_i v_j dim(j) S_i,j = \\[CapitalDelta]+ dim(i)\"] &]\n|>", "Input"],
Cell["Appendix: what is and is not mechanised", "Section"],
Cell["The pointed models (graded vector spaces) have all multiplicities N^k_(i\:2297j) \:2264 1; non-simple objects X carry the larger multiplicities. Lemma 4.9 and 4.10 are checked with w(g) = 2^g, where dim_l \:2260 dim_r, so every dimension factor matters.", "Item"],
Cell["Lemma 4.6(b) as printed, \:03a3_j v_i v_j dim(j) S_i,j = dim(C) dim(i), fails in the modular categories Z/3 and Z/5 (its left side is the Gauss sum \:0394+). With \:0394+ in place of dim(C) it holds, and \:0394+ \:0394\:2212 = dim(C) holds as stated in \:00a74.5.2.", "Item"],
Cell["The steps of the proofs of Lemma 4.9(d), (e) that are about single basis vectors (\:03bb_\:03b1,\:03b2) are checked through the statements they prove; the editor's symbolic rules cover Lemma 4.2, (4.7)\:2013(4.10), Lemma 4.8 for S = (X,+), Lemma 4.9(a)\:2013(d) and the duality and (4.12) steps of Lemma 4.10. Lemma 4.9(e)\:2013(g) and the Lemma 4.9(e) step of Lemma 4.10 are checked here, in matrices.", "Item"],
Cell["\:00a9 Computational Classnotes \:00b7 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0", "Text"]
}, StyleDefinitions -> "Default.nb"]
